plan: {'kind': 'task', 'skills': [{'name': 'background-jobs', 'description': 'Background jobs & task queues — workers, scheduling, retries with backoff, idempotency, dead-letter queues, at-least-once delivery', 'triggers': ['background jobs', 'task queue', 'job queue', 'celery', 'cron', 'worker', 'retry'], 'content': '# Background Jobs & Task Queues\n\n## Core Skills\n\n| Skill | Practice |\n|---|---|\n| Enqueue | Hand off slow work so the request path stays fast |\n| Workers | Horizontally scaled consumers with graceful shutdown |\n| Retries | Bounded exponential backoff plus jitter; cap the attempts |\n| Idempotency | Make a re-delivered job safe to run twice |\n| Scheduling | Delayed and recurring jobs with a single owner per slot |\n| Dead-letter | Park poisoned jobs with context for inspection |\n| Visibility | Queue depth, age and failure rate as first-class metrics |\n| Ordering | Per-key serialization only where the domain demands it |\n\n## Pitfalls\n- At-least-once delivery is the norm, so non-idempotent handlers duplicate work.\n- Retrying a permanent failure forever hides bugs and floods the queue.\n- Unbounded queues delay detection; alert on age, not just depth.\n- A worker that ignores shutdown in-flight loses jobs mid-processing.\n\n## Practice Project\nBuild one queue with a worker, exponential-backoff retries, an idempotency key, a dead-letter queue, and dashboards for depth, age and failures; then kill a worker mid-job and prove the task still completes exactly once in effect.\n\n## Key Resources\n- [Celery](https://docs.celeryq.dev/)\n- [BullMQ](https://docs.bullmq.io/)\n- [Enterprise Integration Patterns — Idempotent Receiver](https://www.enterpriseintegrationpatterns.com/)', 'file_path': '/Users/shadow/machina/skills/background-jobs/SKILL.md', 'version': '1.0.0', 'enabled': True, 'usage_count': 0, 'view_count': 0, 'last_activity_at': None, 'source': '', 'source_type': 'local', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 16, 1, 44, 912737, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'metadata': {}}, {'name': 'llm-provider', 'description': 'LLM provider abstraction — OpenAI-compatible API, streaming, tool calling, token counting, retry logic, cost tracking, model fallback', 'triggers': ['provider', 'openrouter', 'ollama', 'streaming', 'tool calling', 'token count'], 'content': '# LLM Provider Abstraction\n\n## Core Skills\n\n| Skill | Practice |\n|---|---|\n| OpenAI-compatible API | Works with OpenRouter, Nous, Ollama |\n| Streaming | Token-level output |\n| Tool calling | Function calling with JSON Schema |\n| Token counting | tiktoken for accurate counts |\n| Retry logic | Exponential backoff with jitter |\n| Cost tracking | Track tokens in/out, estimate cost |\n| Model fallback | Primary → secondary → local |\n\n## Key Resources\n- [OpenAI Python SDK](https://github.com/openai/openai-python)\n- [OpenRouter docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs)\n- [tiktoken](https://github.com/openai/tiktoken)\n- [LiteLLM](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)\n\n## Practice Project\nBuild a provider abstraction: LLMProvider interface with chat(), stream(), count_tokens(). Implement for OpenRouter and Ollama. Add retry + fallback.', 'file_path': '/Users/shadow/machina/skills/llm-provider/SKILL.md', 'version': '1.0.0', 'enabled': True, 'usage_count': 0, 'view_count': 0, 'last_activity_at': None, 'source': '', 'source_type': 'local', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 16, 34, 20, 296209, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'metadata': {}}, {'name': 'ecc-cost-aware-llm-pipeline', 'description': 'Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching. Use when LLM spend needs to come down, or when routing tasks across model tiers and budgets.', 'triggers': [], 'content': '', 'file_path': '/Users/shadow/machina/skills/ecc/skills/cost-aware-llm-pipeline/SKILL.md', 'version': '1.0.0', 'enabled': True, 'usage_count': 0, 'view_count': 0, 'last_activity_at': None, 'source': 'https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC/tree/4eb71d92a39cab44ad40ac9d8a6a5ccb4029d6c2', 'source_type': 'builtin-ecc', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 16, 35, 38, 726165, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'metadata': {'bundle_path': 'skills/cost-aware-llm-pipeline/SKILL.md', 'revision': '4eb71d92a39cab44ad40ac9d8a6a5ccb4029d6c2'}}], 'stages': [('requested workflow', 'background-jobs'), ('specialist', 'llm-provider'), ('specialist', 'ecc-cost-aware-llm-pipeline')]}
